Third-Party Components
p-lanes is an orchestrator. It does not bundle or depend on any specific
STT or TTS engine; these are swappable providers. The following are
commonly used with p-lanes, and their respective licenses remain in effect:

  llama.cpp: MIT License (required; the inference backend)
  Whisper:   MIT License (default STT provider, swappable)
  Kokoro:    Apache 2.0 License (default TTS provider, swappable)
  Piper:     MIT License (alternative TTS provider)
